<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on Swiss Market Index.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on Swiss Market Index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citabank said it has issued a total of 10 million call and put warrants in four equal tranches on the Swiss Market Index.</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   13.JUL.98		 PAYDATE	16.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT    STRIKE     ISSUE    * WARRANT    STRIKE     ISSUE</p>
<p> CALL A     6,000 CHF  5.53 CHF * PUT B	5,750 CHF  3.72 CHF</p>
<p> CALL C     6,250 CHF  4.32 CHF * PUT D	6,000 CHF  4.73 CHF</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
